      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "there are things YOU can do to make it difficult for people to use stuff they steal from you. such as creating shapekeys that will completely deform your models unless you set those shapekeys to specific values. and for other things you can just make sure you make the models for a specific use (you can delete all polys that won't be seen when you upload it) making the models almost completely useless anywhere other than where you had it.\nAs for games protecting asset rips, that isn't a game problem, that is an asset problem and asset filetype problem. there is almost nothing vrchat can do, which should be obvious when you see all the people running around in models ripped from countless games. \nthe only thing you can be sure of, is anyone who rips models doesn't have the patience to find out how to set yours up correctly, or the ability to fix any models that you made for a specific scenario.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
