      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just found sites like this and immediately was disguised to see some of my friends hard work and livelihoods. The ripper issue is getting worse by the day and as someone who would love to take creation on VRChat more seriously this issue needs to be addressed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
